; Room script 7: Abandoned church
;
; Entered through its left door, behind which the door closes: while #R$851A is nonzero it draws the left door
; #R$76A0.
; .
; Room 7: column 2, row 1 of the 5x5 map (left is room 6, right 8, up 2, down 12, counted modulo 25). Subscripts:
; #R$82F0, #R$7360, #R$7358, #R$76B0. Items (#R$8EDF) at row,column: church door trigger 15,2.
@label=RoomScript07
b$75E1 DEFB $87,$07         ; ROOMNAME 7 "Abandoned church"
 $75E3 DEFB $83 ; CALL ScriptRoomPanel
@isub=DEFW ScriptRoomPanel
 $75E4 DEFW $82F0
